/atlas
/dist/
*.test

# Browser-check leftovers. The radial view (ADR-0001) is verified by loading a
# rendered page in a real browser, and the driver writes its snapshots and
# screenshots here as a side effect. They are evidence from one run, not part
# of the repo. Scoped to this directory deliberately: a broader pattern such as
# /*.png would also swallow an image someone legitimately adds at the root, and
# a file missing from git status is worse than one that has to be ignored.
/.playwright-mcp/

# Vendored SDLC pipeline skills and their per-ticket working files.
# The skills are vendored from another repo, so this repo is not their source of
# truth: tracking them would ship ~1k lines Atlas did not author under Atlas's
# own LICENSE, and would point contributors at a forge, a multi-repo workspace
# and design assets that a public clone of Atlas does not have. They stay on
# disk and keep working locally; they are simply not part of the published
# artifact. Untracked rather than deleted, so re-vendoring stays a no-op.
.agent/
.claude/skills
